   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint evaluation, with DFID as lead, on public sector governance reform. Approach paper to develop the final ToR and define stakeholder participation ready by February 2010. The evaluation will provide input to the high level meeting in Seoul 2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samutv&#xE4;rdering, med DFID som lead, om reformer av offentlig  f&#xF6;rvaltning. Ett approach paper f&#xE4;rdigst&#xE4;lls till v&#xE5;ren 2010 f&#xF6;r att utveckla slutgiltig ToR samt definiera samarbetspartners deltagande. Utv&#xE4;rderingen ska ge input till h&#xF6;gniv&#xE5;m&#xF6;tet i Seoul 2011.</narrative>
